?▲걽?묆겎?녴걢?뚣곩콏?끹꺕掠뗥쨼??뙷?γ굮**?곥걼?ゃ걚** ??\\r\\n * ?뚧윶?곫쥈?곮먨뒟鶯곥띹죱?③걬?녴귛뀯?쎼겓營?걦?①뵽?㏂겓?밤걢?ゃ걚?ㅳ겲?욍걣訝╉겤??\\r\\n *\\r\\n * 亮끾?嶺뗣굮?곥걼?ゃ걚??겘?먬쐡鶯곥겏?뚣걯?녺뵳?㎯걗?뗣??싧뎴3) ?뚪빓?뺛굮訝롢걟?뗩깿?먦겗\\r\\n * ?쀦뙔??뚦읃鹽롦쥈?곫쥈?곩즯歟곥곩즯?띲겎佯딀씮?뚣겒?뤵곫쑍?겹굮若싥굙?뗦씉?뉎굚?ゃ걚??\\r\\n */\\r\\nexport interface SlabSection {\\r\\n  id: string\\r\\n  kind: '佯딀씮'\\r\\n  mark: string\\r\\n  /** ColumnSection.storyLabel ?ⓨ릪?섅?*/\\r\\n  storyLabel?: string\\r\\n  /** ?욕럻 (mm) */\\r\\n  thickness: number\\r\\n  fc: number\\r\\n  grade: SteelGrade\\r\\n  finish: Finish\\r\\n  /** 訝사춮??텤?뗦뼶凉뤵귞텤?뗧츋??겹겏鼇?쮫?룔걬?멥겗嶸쀥뀯?믤군?곥굥 */\\r\\n  spliceMethod: SpliceMethod\\r\\n  /** X?싥굤?밧릲竊늌邕멥겓亦욍겂?╊섯?녈굥竊됥겗訝사춮 */\\r\\n  x: { top: SlabBarRow; bottom: SlabBarRow }\\r\\n  /** Y?싥굤?밧릲??말嶺?*/\\r\\n  y: { top: SlabBarRow; bottom: SlabBarRow }\\r\\n}\\r\\n\\r\\nexport type Section =\\r\\n  | ColumnSection\\r\\n  | GirderSection\\r\\n  | WallSection\\r\\n  | SlabSection\\r\\n\\r\\n/**\\r\\n * ?붾㈃ ?쒖떆쨌aria-label???대쫫. 媛숈? 寧?뤇???롫퀎濡??щ윭 ??씊???????덉쑝誘濡?\\r\\n * ?롫? ?ш린??遺숈씤??????λ릺??`mark`???꾨㈃??寧?뤇 洹몃?濡??붾떎.\\r\\n */\\r\\nexport function sectionMarkLabel(section: Section): string {\\r\\n  return section.storyLabel\\r\\n    ? `${section.mark}(${section.storyLabel})`\\r\\n    : section.mark\\r\\n}\\r\\n\\r\\nexport interface ColumnPosition {\\r\\n  ix: number\\r\\n  iy: number\\r\\n}\\r\\n\\r\\nexport interface GirderPosition {\\r\\n  axis: 'X' | 'Y'\\r\\n  ix: number\\r\\n  iy: number\\r\\n}\\r\\n\\r\\n/**\\r\\n * ?먬쐡鶯곥겗鵝띸쉰?귛ㄷ歟곥겏?뚣걯?뤻싥굤??겗1?밤깙?녑늽??씌?믣뜝?곥굥??겎壤㏂굚?뚣걯?㎯걗?뗣?\\r\\n *\\r\\n * TypeScript ??쭓?좂쉪?뗤퍡?묆겒??겎?곩닪?띲굮鵝쒌겂?╉굚?뗣겏?쀣겍??GirderPosition ??\\r\\n * ?뷴닪?뺛굦?ゃ걚 ???⒲걾?됥겎?귙굥?뗣굮黎뷩굙?뗣겗??만??`Member.kind` ??뼶?졼귚퐤營?걽?묆굮\\r\\n * 誤뗣겍?ⓩ쓲葉?닪?믣닩若싥걲?뗣궠?쇈깋?믤쎑?뗣겒?꾠걪?ⓦ?\\r\\n */\\r\\nexport type WallPosition = GirderPosition\\r\\n\\r\\n/**\\r\\n * 佯딀씮??퐤營????싥굤??겎?꿔겲?뚣걼1?쇻궎?믣뜝?곥굥??ix, iy) ??걹??깧?ㅳ겗?잏궧??\\r\\n * 竊늌?팢 ?ⓦ굚弱뤵걬?꾢겢竊됥겗?쇔춴?밤겎?곥깧?ㅳ겘 (ix, iy)??ix+1, iy+1) ?㎯걗?뗣?\\r\\n *\\r\\n * ?긱겗 ColumnPosition ?ⓨ숱??릪?섅걽?뚧뙁?쇻굚??걣?뺛걝竊덃졏耶먪궧?뗣깧?ㅳ걢竊됥?\\r\\n * TypeScript ??쭓?좂쉪?뗤퍡?묆겒??겎?뗣겎??뙷?γ걬?뚣겒?????⒲걾?됥겎?귙굥?뗣굮\\r\\n * 黎뷩굙?뗣겗??만??`Member.kind` ??뼶?졼?\\r\\n */\\r\\nexport type SlabPosition = ColumnPosition\\r\\n\\r\\n/**\\r\\n * ?뗥룭??1?뗦? (?곈뇧令띸츞?뷸틬 1?싧뎴8))??\\r\\n *\\r\\n * ??씊?㎯겘?ゃ걦 **?ⓩ쓲** ?ヤ퍡?뤵귛릪?섊Е?룔겗鶯곥걣鵝뺞옔?귛뻠?ㅳ겗?ャ곭첆??걹???싥겓\\r\\n * ?뗣걚?╉걚?뗣걢?됥걽 ????씊?ユ똻?잆걵?뗣겏?녜씊?ャ겒?꾦뼀?ｃ굮獒썲뱚?뚥퍟??즯?ャ굚鵝쒌굥\\r\\n * ?볝겏?ャ겒??(ADR-004)??\\r\\n *\\r\\n * 佯㎪쮽??깿?먦겗掠?楹삠겎?곩렅?밤겘**?끾퀡?잆겗?잏궧**?㎯걗?뗣귟먬쐡鶯곥겒?됧쭓塋?겗?긱겗\\r\\n * ?끻겢?㏂꺕訝딃깿鸚㎪쥈??툔?㏂걢?됪릍?ｃ걼訝뗧ク?곩틞?욍겒?됥꺀?녈겗冶뗧ク??ㄷ歟곩냵?닻씊??\\r\\n * 掠? x?퍈 ??릲?띲겘?띸춮竊?Rebar.points`竊됥겏?뚣걯?ゃ겗?㎯곩즯?㎯겘 x ?뚦즯??빓?뺛?\\r\\n * y ?뚦즯??쳵?뺛곩틞?욍겎??x?퍈 ?뚣걹?뚣걻??X?싥굤?팢?싥굤?밧릲?ャ겒?뗣?\\r\\n *\\r\\n * 野멩퀡??뚦뻠?룬줊嶺됮뼀?ｉ깿??*?끾퀡野멩퀡**?띯??뚪쟿?뚣걹?녶츣?곥굥??\\r\\n */\\r\\nexport interface Opening {\\r\\n  id: string\\r\\n  /** ?끾퀡?잆겗?잏궧?뗣굢?뗥룭?얇겎???? x (mm) */\\r\\n  xMm: number\\r\\n  /** ?뚣걯?뤷?? y (mm) */\\r\\n  yMm: number\\r\\n  /** 掠? x ?밧릲??냵力뺝?力?(mm) */\\r\\n  widthMm: number\\r\\n  /** 掠? y ?밧릲??냵力뺝?力?(mm) */\\r\\n  heightMm: number\\r\\n}\\r\\n\\r\\nexport interface Member {\\r\\n  id: string\\r\\n  kind: MemberKind\\r\\n  memberClass: MemberClass\\r\\n  sectionId: string\\r\\n  storyId: string\\r\\n  position: ColumnPosition | GirderPosition | WallPosition | SlabPosition\\r\\n  /**\\r\\n   * ?볝겗?ⓩ쓲?ラ뼀?꾠겍?꾠굥?뗥룭??(1?싧뎴8))?귝쑋?뉐츣??뚪뼀?ｃ겒?쀣띲겎?귙겂??\\r\\n   * ?뚧쑋?ε뒟?띲겎??겒????獒썲뱚??뼀?ｃ겗?됬꽒?믤렓若싥걮?ゃ걚??겎?곩냵鼇녔쎑??뼀?ｈ짒凉루춮??\\r\\n   * 鼇덁툓?쀣겍?꾠겒?꾠걪?ⓦ굮躍멩셽?딁윥?쇻굥 (R14)?귝윶?삣ㄷ歟곥겘?쀣걨?뽧굢?ゃ걚竊싧릪?끹걣\\r\\n   * ?쇻걩?뗣겗??첆?삣눣?ε룭嶺됥겎?곥걹?뚣걣?뗣걦??겘鶯곥겏佯딀씮?졼걢?됥겎?귙굥??\\r\\n   */\\r\\n  openings?: Opening[]\\r\\n}\\r\\n\\n--- member.test.ts ---\\r\\nimport { describe, expect, expectTypeOf, it } from 'vitest'\\r\\n\\r\\nimport {\\r\\n  BAR_SIZES,\\r\\n  HIGH_STRENGTH_SHEAR_BAR_SIZES,\\r\\n  SHEAR_BAR_SIZES,\\r\\n  sectionMarkLabel,\\r\\n  splitGirderMainRow,\\r\\n  type BarSize,\\r\\n  type ColumnSection,\\r\\n  type GirderSection,\\r\\n  type HighStrengthShearBarSize,\\r\\n  type Member,\\r\\n  type MemberClass,\\r\\n  type MemberKind,\\r\\n  type Section,\\r\\n  type ShearBarSize,\\r\\n  type SteelGrade,\\r\\n  type WallSection,\\r\\n} from './member'\\r\\n\\r\\ndescribe('member model', () => {\\r\\n  it('supports ?긱꺕鸚㎪쥈?삭먬쐡鶯곥꺕佯딀씮 as member kinds', () => {\\r\\n    // ?먬쐡鶯곥겘 ADR-025?곩틞?욍겘 ADR-028 ?㎩뒥?뤵겂?잆귛즯凉뤸쭓?졼겗鶯곥꺕?븀쨴?삣컦歟곥꺕\\r\\n    // ?묈즯??풚?뜰겏?쀣겍?ⓩ쓲?ャ걮?ゃ걚 ???볝걪?뚦쥥?덀굥?ⓦ걤??ADR ?믢섦?녴?\\r\\n    expectTypeOf<MemberKind>().toEqualTypeOf<\\r\\n      '?? | '鸚㎪쥈' | '?먬쐡鶯? | '佯딀씮'\\r\\n    >()\\r\\n    expectTypeOf<MemberClass>().toEqualTypeOf<'翁?퐪'>()\\r\\n  })\\r\\n\\r\\n  it('keeps the supported input bar sizes and steel grades explicit', () => {\\r\\n    expectTypeOf<BarSize>().toEqualTypeOf<\\r\\n      'D10' | 'D13' | 'D16' | 'D19' | 'D22' | 'D25' | 'D29' | 'D32'\\r\\n    >()\\r\\n    expectTypeOf<SteelGrade>().toEqualTypeOf<'SD295' | 'SD345' | 'SD390'>()\\r\\n  })\\r\\n\\r\\n  it('discriminates sections by their Japanese member kind', () => {\\r\\n    const column: ColumnSection = {\\r\\n      id: 'section-C1',\\r\\n      kind: '??,\\r\\n      mark: 'C1',\\r\\n      shape: '?⒴숱',\\r\\n      b: 800,\\r\\n      d: 800,\\r\\n      fc: 24,\\r\\n      grade: 'SD345',\\r\\n      exposure: '掠뗥쨼',\\r\\n      finish: '餓뺜툓?믡겒??,\\r\\n      spliceMethod: '?띲겖泳숁뎸',\\r\\n      main: { size: 'D25', count: 12 },\\r\\n      hoop: { size: 'D13', pitch: 100, startOffsetMm: 0 },\\r\\n    }\\r\\n    const girder: GirderSection = {\\r\\n      id: 'section-G1',\\r\\n      kind: '鸚㎪쥈',\\r\\n      mark: 'G1',\\r\\n      b: 400,\\r\\n      depth: 750,\\r\\n      fc: 24,\\r\\n      grade: 'SD345',\\r\\n      exposure: '掠뗥쨼',\\r\\n      finish: '餓뺜툓?믡겒??,\\r\\n      spliceMethod: '?띲겖泳숁뎸',\\r\\n      main: {\\r\\n        size: 'D25',\\r\\n        top: { endCount: 4, centerCount: 4 },\\r\\n        bottom: { endCount: 4, centerCount: 4 },\\r\\n        cutoffFromSupportFaceMm: 0,\\r\\n      },\\r\\n      stirrup: { size: 'D13', pitch: 100, startOffsetMm: 50 },\\r\\n    }\\r\\n    const sections: Section[] = [column, girder]\\r\\n    const members: Member[] = [\\r\\n      {\\r\\n        id: '1F-X1Y1',\\r\\n        kind: '??,\\r\\n        memberClass: '翁?퐪',\\r\\n        sectionId: column.id,\\r\\n        storyId: '1F',\\r\\n        position: { ix: 0, iy: 0 },\\r\\n      },\\r\\n      {\\r\\n        id: '1F-G1-X1Y1-X',\\r\\n        kind: '鸚㎪쥈',\\r\\n        memberClass: '翁?퐪',\\r\\n        sectionId: girder.id,\\r\\n        storyId: '1F',\\r\\n        position: { axis: 'X', ix: 0, iy: 0 },\\r\\n      },\\r\\n    ]\\r\\n\\r\\n    expect(sections.map(({ kind }) => kind)).toEqual(['??, '鸚㎪쥈'])\\r\\n    expect(members.map(({ kind }) => kind)).toEqual(['??, '鸚㎪쥈'])\\r\\n  })\\r\\n\\r\\n  it('composes the story label for display without storing it in mark', () => {\\r\\n    const base: ColumnSection = {\\r\\n      id: 'section-C51',\\r\\n      kind: '??,\\r\\n      mark: 'C51',\\r\\n      shape: '?⒴숱',\\r\\n      b: 800,\\r\\n      d: 800,\\r\\n      fc: 24,\\r\\n      grade: 'SD345',\\r\\n      exposure: '掠뗥쨼',\\r\\n      finish: '餓뺜툓?믡겒??,\\r\\n      spliceMethod: '?띲겖泳숁뎸',\\r\\n      main: { size: 'D25', count: 18 },\\r\\n      hoop: { size: 'D13', pitch: 100, startOffsetMm: 0 },\\r\\n    }\\r\\n\\r\\n    expect(sectionMarkLabel(base)).toBe('C51')\\r\\n    expect(sectionMarkLabel({ ...base, storyLabel: '2?? })).toBe('C51(2??')\\r\\n    // ?낁㉢?몃뒗 ?대? ?롫퀎濡?臾띠씤??????λ릺??寧?뤇?먮뒗 ?롪? ?ㅼ뼱媛吏 ?딅뒗??\\r\\n    expect({ ...base, storyLabel: '2?? }.mark).toBe('C51')\\r\\n  })\\r\\n})\\r\\n\\r\\ndescribe('splitGirderMainRow', () => {\\r\\n  // 令띸츞?뷸틬 2竊덌폆竊됪쥈1) ?뚦츣?곥굥??겘?뚧쥈??뀲?룔겓?뤵걼?뗤말嶺뗣띲걽?묆겎??\\r\\n  // ?덀긿?쀧춮?삭짒凉루춮嶺됥겘鼇?쮫?녔쎑?ュ쭟??굢?뚣굥 ??弱묆겒?꾣뼶?뚪싥걮嶺뗣겎?귙굥??\\r\\n  it('塋?깿?뚦쩀?꾣뼪?㏂겎??량?뚨ク?ⓨ겢??궖?껁깉?ゃ깢嶺뗣겓?ゃ굥', () => {\\r\\n    expect(splitGirderMainRow({ endCount: 5, centerCount: 3 })).toEqual({\\r\\n      throughCount: 3,\\r\\n      cutoffCount: 2,\\r\\n      cutoffAt: '塋?깿',\\r\\n    })\\r\\n  })\\r\\n\\r\\n  it('訝?ㄾ?뚦쩀?꾣뼪?㏂겎??량?뚥릎鸚?겢??궖?껁깉?ゃ깢嶺뗣겓?ゃ굥', () => {\\r\\n    expect(splitGirderMainRow({ endCount: 2, centerCount: 4 })).toEqual({\\r\\n      throughCount: 2,\\r\\n      cutoffCount: 2,\\r\\n      cutoffAt: '訝?ㄾ',\\r\\n    })\\r\\n  })\\r\\n\\r\\n  it('?뚧빊?ゃ굢?싥걮嶺뗣걽?묆겎?ャ긿?덀궕?뺟춮??쳦?잆겒??, () => {\\r\\n    expect(splitGirderMainRow({ endCount: 4, centerCount: 4 })).toMatchObject({\\r\\n      throughCount: 4,\\r\\n      cutoffCount: 0,\\r\\n    })\\r\\n  })\\r\\n})\\r\\n\\r\\ndescribe('遙섇섭佯╉걵?볠뼪獒쒎섭嶺?(鸚㎬눂沃띶츣??', () => {\\r\\n  it('??걵?볠뼪獒쒎섭嶺뗣겓?졼걨鼇긱걬?뚣곦말嶺뗣꺕鶯곭춮?ャ겘?뗣겏?쀣겍?γ굢?ゃ걚', () => {\\r\\n    // 訝사춮?삣즯嶺뗣겗孃꾠겘烏?.3.2(?띲겖泳숁뎸)?삭〃5.3.4(若싩?)?믣폊?뤵귙걹??〃??\\r\\n    // 遙섇섭佯╉걵?볠뼪獒쒎섭嶺뗣겗烏뚣겘?ゃ걚??겎?곩뀯?뚣굦?계쫸繹뽧겓?ゃ걚?ㅳ굮凉뺛걦?볝겏?ャ겒?뗣?\\r\\n    // ?뺛꺖?쀣꺕?밤궭?⒲긿?쀣걽?묆걣 1?싧뎴2) ??뼪?℡뫅?룔겎黎뷩겲?듿푶?믣폊?뗣겒?꾠?\\r\\n    expectTypeOf<HighStrengthShearBarSize>().toEqualTypeOf<'K13' | 'S13'>()\\r\\n    expectTypeOf<ShearBarSize>().toEqualTypeOf<BarSize | HighStrengthShearBarSize>()\\r\\n    expectTypeOf<ColumnSection['main']['size']>().toEqualTypeOf<BarSize>()\\r\\n    expectTypeOf<ColumnSection['hoop']['size']>().toEqualTypeOf<ShearBarSize>()\\r\\n    expectTypeOf<GirderSection['stirrup']['size']>().toEqualTypeOf<ShearBarSize>()\\r\\n    expectTypeOf<WallSection['vertical']['size']>().toEqualTypeOf<BarSize>()\\r\\n    expectTypeOf<WallSection['horizontal']['size']>().toEqualTypeOf<BarSize>()\\r\\n  })\\r\\n\\r\\n  it('??뫜?녑릫?뚣걹??겲?얍뫜?녑푶?㎯걗?????겹걮?꾣빊?ㅳ굮?곥걼?ゃ걚', () => {\\r\\n    // D13 ??13 ?ⓨ릪?섋쫸榮꾠걽?귚륫?잍뻼?ラ쳵凉룟벧?쎼굯??짒凉루춮??쮼瓦겹겘訝佯╉굚?ゃ걦\\r\\n    // (ADR-026)?곮＝?곥걣?곥겍?뗣겗??쎋?㏂걣?멥걚?잌뫜?녑릫?졼걨?㎯걗?뗣?\\r\\n    expect(SHEAR_BAR_SIZES).toEqual([\\r\\n      ...BAR_SIZES,\\r\\n      ...HIGH_STRENGTH_SHEAR_BAR_SIZES,\\r\\n    ])\\r\\n    for (const size of HIGH_STRENGTH_SHEAR_BAR_SIZES) {\\r\\n      expect(size).toMatch(/^[A-Z]\\\\d+(\\\\.\\\\d+)?$/)\\r\\n      expect(BAR_SIZES).not.toContain(size)\\r\\n    }\\r\\n  })\\r\\n})\\r\\n\\n--- project.ts ---\\r\\nimport {\\r\\n  MEMBER_KINDS,\\r\\n  type ColumnSection,\\r\\n  type ColumnPosition,\\r\\n  type GirderPosition,\\r\\n  type GirderSection,\\r\\n  type Member,\\r\\n  type MemberKind,\\r\\n  type Opening,\\r\\n  type Section,\\r\\n  type ShearBarSize,\\r\\n  type SlabPosition,\\r\\n} from './member'\\r\\nimport { MemberUnsupportedError } from './unsupported'\\r\\nimport { coverConditions } from '../rules/lookup'\\r\\n\\r\\n// v2 (2026-08-12): Section???꾩닔 ?꾨뱶 exposure쨌finish 異붽? ??v1 JSON?\\r\\n// deserializeProject??踰꾩쟾 寃뚯씠?몄뿉??紐낆떆?곸쑝濡?嫄곕??쒕떎 (?곸냽 v1 ?곗씠???놁쓬).\\r\\n// v3 (2026-08-12): GirderSection.stirrup???꾩닔 ?꾨뱶 startOffsetMm 異붽?. 誤뤸틬??// ?녿뒗 諛곗튂媛믪쓣 猷고뙥??媛吏?異쒖쿂濡??ｋ뒗 ????낅젰?쇰줈 諛쏅뒗??(ADR-012).\\r\\n// v4 (2026-08-12): ColumnSection.hoop?먮룄 媛숈? ?댁쑀濡?startOffsetMm 異붽?.\\r\\n// ??媛믪씠 躍?춮 ?ф빊(=臾쇰웾)瑜?醫뚯슦?섎?濡??쒗뭹 ?곸닔濡??먯? ?딅뒗??\\r\\n// v5 (2026-08-14): Section???꾩닔 ?꾨뱶 spliceMethod 異붽?. 泳숁뎸嶸뉑??곗? ?ㅺ퀎湲몄씠\\r\\n// ?곗엯??諛⑹떇留덈떎 ?ㅻⅨ??令띸츞?뷸틬 1?싧뎴4)쨌5)) 洹쒖???湲곕낯 諛⑹떇???놁쑝誘濡?// 議곗슜??湲곕낯媛?????낅젰?쇰줈 諛쏅뒗??\\r\\n// v6 (2026-08-20): Project???좏깮 ?꾨뱶 unitMass 異붽?. ?곈뇧令띸츞?뷸틬 1?싧뎴 ?띷뻼?\\r\\n// 蘊ら뇧???뚩Þ鼇덆빓??횞 JIS G 3112 ??뜕鵝띹나?뤵띿쑝濡??뺤쓽??肉?媛??먯껜??JIS??// ?꾩엫?쒕떎. JIS???좊즺 洹쒓꺽?대씪 ?뺣낫?섏? 紐삵뻽怨? ?쎌? ?딆? 臾명뿄??猷고뙥??// ?뷴끂???몄슱 ?섎뒗 ?놁쑝誘濡?ADR-003) 媛믪쓣 ?낅젰?쇰줈 諛쏅뒗?? 誘몄엯??孃꾩? ?ㅺ?\\r\\n// ?녾퀬, 洹?孃꾩쓽 kg? ?곗텧?섏? ?딅뒗??\\r\\n// v7 (2026-08-21): GirderSection????媛덈옒 蹂寃쎌씠 ?④퍡 ?ㅼ뼱媛붾떎 ??????// ?곸냽 ?곗씠?곌? ?녿뒗 ?곹깭?먯꽌 媛숈? ?먯쑝濡??섍?誘濡?踰꾩쟾? ?섎굹??\\r\\n//   ??(M3b) main ??topCount쨌bottomCount ?믢퐤營?닪 (塋?깿쨌訝?ㄾ) ??GirderMainRow ??//      營?걤?쎼걟?곥궖?껁깉?ゃ깢鵝띸쉰?믣퓚?덂뀯?쎼겓?쀣걼?귞찉嶸쀥읃繹?2竊덌폆竊됪쥈1) ?뚦츣?곥굥??겘\\r\\n//      ?뚧쥈??뀲?룔겓?뤵걼?뗤말嶺뗣띲걽?묆겎?곥깉?껁깤嶺뗧춬??Þ鼇덂쎋?멥겓冶붵겖?됥굦????//      鵝띸쉰?ζ쑍?겹걣?ゃ걚?③싥걮嶺뗣겏?ャ긿?덀궕?뺟춮?믣늽?묆굢?뚣겒?꾠?//   ??(M3c) 餓삥꼷 ?꾨뱶 widthTie쨌sideBar 異붽?. ?????뚧뼪?㏘?誤㏃뿉 ?놁쑝硫?洹?諛곌렐??//      ?녿떎?띾? ?삵븯??optional?대떎 ???덈뒗吏 ?녿뒗吏瑜??쒗뭹???뺥븯吏 ?딅뒗??\\r\\n//      ?밭춮??鵝숅빓? 令띸츞?뷸틬 1?싧뎴6)??JASS 5???꾩엫?섎뒗??洹?洹쒓꺽??誘명솗蹂대씪\\r\\n//      猷고뙥 ?됱씠 ?꾨땲???낅젰?쇰줈 諛쏅뒗??(R9??.\\r\\n// v8 (2026-08-22): ?먬쐡鶯곥굮?ⓩ쓲?ⓦ걮??룛?묈룚?뗣괣emberKind ??'?먬쐡鶯??갨ection ??//   WallSection ?뚦뒥?뤵굤?갡ember.position ??ㄷ歟곥겏?뚣걯渦뷩겗鵝띸쉰?믢슴?녴귝빊?뤹찉嶸쀥읃繹?//   2竊덌폊竊됧즯1)竊덂즯凉뤸쭓?졽빳鸚뽳펹?ⓦ곮변鵝볝겗?뷴늽竊덌폊竊됧즯?뚧윶?곫쥈?곩틞?욜춬?ユ렏?쇻굥?귞쎍?먦겗\\r\\n//   ?끾퀡?ⓨ늽?띲겓野얍퓶?쇻굥